-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",425,{
[13569]="700563D8\n1\tComplete 'Seeking The Treasure Bugans!' (total: 4)\tTheodore Gorse is searching for his stolen treasures. NOTE: Treasure Bugans can be found in many of the Scaling Instances.\n2\tTalk to Theodore Gorse in Bree, Rivendell, or Twenty-first Hall\tTheodore Gorse is searching for his stolen treasures and can be found in Bree, Rivendell, and the Twenty-first Hall. You should talk to Theodore Gorse.\n",
[13570]="7006A9EC\n1\tFind the forsaken camp\tDiscover where the forsaken Heirsworn and Church of the All-seeing Eye are encamped. Porókho said they are in the southernmost part of Ilmabiri.\n2\tDefeat fugitives (total: 6)\030Free Khetúku\tYou have found the location of the camp of forsaken. You should defeat some of them so Khetúku will be able to escape.\n3\tTalk to Porókho\tYou have defeated many of the fugitives and freed Khetúku. You should return to Porókho at his camp in the sewers to bring him the news.\n",
[13571]="7000E83C\n1\tDefeat Dourhands in Nan Amlug (total: 15)\tDourhands can be found throughout the hills of western Nan Amlug, north-west of Esteldín. Handarod has asked you to disrupt the Dourhand mining efforts in Nan Amlug.\n2\tTalk to Handarod\tHandarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, south-east of Nan Amlug. You should return to Handarod and tell him of your battles against the Dourhands.\n",
[13572]="7006000D\n1\tRetrieve traps from a supply chest\tEiricháv can be found in north-west Câr Bronach. You should retrieve traps from a supply chest.\n2\tLay traps at the Iron Pass (quantity: see journal)\tBálach Iaran, the Iron Pass can be found in west Câr Bronach. You should lay traps at the Iron Pass for Suilgál.\n3\tTalk to Suilgál\tEiricháv can be found in north-west Câr Bronach. You should talk to Suilgál.\n",
[13573]="700173BD\n1\tHelp Vagun disable alarms in Fil Gashan\030Help Vagun with lieutenants in Fil Gashan\030Help Úlfur gather plans from Fil Gashan\030Help Yngvi defeat General Talug in Fil Gashan\tÚlfur, Vagun, and Yngvi can be found in Anazârmekhem. Teitur directed you to speak with his aides and complete their tasks before he tells Narfi that Fil Gashan is no longer a threat.\n2\tTalk to Teitur in Anazârmekhem\tTeitur can be found in Anazârmekhem. You successfully completed each of the tasks Úlfur, Vagun, and Yngvi gave you. Now you should return to Teitur with your report.\n",
[13574]="700173C2\n1\tHelp Thithrand defeat the leaders of the White Hand Orcs within the Grand Stair\030Help Thithrand cripple the White Hand's power in the Grand Stair\tThithrand is at the Orc-watch. Thithrand believes that the White Hand will openly rebel against the Moria Orcs, but fears they could amass enough strength to wrest control for themselves. To avert this, he would like you to complete a variety of tasks.\n2\tTalk to Thithrand at the Orc-watch\tThithrand is at the Orc-watch, south-west of the Grand Stair. You should return to Thithrand with news of your successes in the Grand Stair.\n",
[13575]="7002A187\n1\tDeliver the blotchy skins to the taskmaster at Forthbrond\030Collect blotchy skins (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire blotchy skins. You are to deliver them to the Rohirrim taskmaster at Forthbrond.\n",
[13576]="7002A188\n1\tDeliver the decorative sword sheaths to the taskmaster at Forthbrond\030Collect decorative sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire decorative sword sheaths. You are to deliver them to the Rohirrim taskmaster at Forthbrond.\n",
[13577]="7002A18B\n1\tDeliver the marked furs to the taskmaster at Forthbrond\030Collect marked furs (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire marked furs. You are to deliver them to the Rohirrim taskmaster at Forthbrond.\n",
[13578]="7002A18A\n1\tDeliver the punctured shields to the taskmaster at Forthbrond\030Collect punctured shields (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire punctured shields. You are to deliver them to the Rohirrim taskmaster at Forthbrond.\n",
[13579]="7002A18C\n1\tDeliver the speckled ears to the taskmaster at Forthbrond\030Collect speckled ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire speckled ears. You are to deliver them to the Rohirrim taskmaster at Forthbrond.\n",
[13580]="7006EC23\n1\tCollect seashells (total: 8)\tDarôma has offered to pay you for bringing seashells to her. She suggested looking on the island's northern shores, particularly in and around the channel.\n2\tBring the seashells to Darôma\tYou have collected many splendid-looking seashells from the beaches of Furtherholm. You should bring them to Darôma inside The Cracked Flagon to receive your reward.\n",
[13581]="7002733F\n1\tTalk to Wenda in Tûr Morva\tWenda's home is down the hill to the south of Seren, in Tûr Morva. Seren wants you to bring news of her son Anirin to his beloved Wenda.\n2\tTalk to Seren in Tûr Morva\tSeren is in Tûr Morva. You have given tidings of Anirin to his beloved, and Wenda now wants you to return to Seren with her thanks.\n3\tTalk to Penrod in Tûr Morva\tPenrod is among the northern buildings in Tûr Morva. Penrod wishes to speak with you.\n",
[13582]="70024BD4\n1\tPick up dirty dishes (total: 10)\030Clean up reeking garbage (total: 10)\030Clean up liquid spills (total: 10)\tGarbage can be found at each of the Eating Contest stations in Winter-home, and the servant Basil Wyndham deems himself above the task of cleaning it up. You should clean up garbage, spills, and dirty dishes around the Eating Contest's tables.\n2\tTalk to Basil Wyndham\tBasil Wyndham can be found in Winter-home. You should return to Basil Wyndham now that you have cleaned up some of the mess from the Eating Contest.\n",
[13583]="7003A691\n1\tTalk to the guard\tThere is a Gapholt guard behind a mountain of papers. You should speak with a guard to see if there is an exception that can be made to help the refugees settle into Gapholt sooner.\n2\tTalk to Thane Nothmar\tThane Nothmar is near the bridge of Gapholt. The guard told you to take your concerns to Thane Nothmar.\n3\tTalk to Hrothwaru\tHrothwaru is near the bridge of Gapholt. Thane Nothmar would not recant his position regarding entry into Gapholt.\n",
[13584]="7006228C\n1\tAffix the delving zircon to the delving stone (quantity: see journal)\030Acquire a delving zircon (quantity: see journal)\tYou must place a delving zircon into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tComplete the current mission and find the scout\tA malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSpeak with the mission giver\tHaving completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.\n",
[13585]="70063F98\n1\tAffix the delving zircon to the delving stone (quantity: see journal)\030Acquire a delving zircon (quantity: see journal)\tYou must place a delving zircon into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tFind and open the final chest within the space\tA malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies to rid the evil from the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSpeak with a mission giver that knows about delvings\tHaving completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to a mission giver with knowledge of delvings and tell them of your success.\n",
